# Come Back Wrong destroys a Spirit token of Bot2's Lingering Souls (turn 2): a token is no card (CR 111.1, 111.7), so nothing is
# returned and nothing is sacrificed; the other Spirit stays with Bot2.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Come Back Wrong
Island x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Lingering Souls
Plains x18

[Actions]
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot2.Hand.Lingering Souls.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 2
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Come Back Wrong.Cast(Target: Spirit Token#1)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 0
? Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 1

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield = Spirit Token
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 0
Bot1.Graveyard = Come Back Wrong; Black Lotus
